<title>SRI LANKA: Hayleys 6-mth net 10 pct up.</title>
<headline>Hayleys 6-mth net 10 pct up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Hayleys Ltd for the six-months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			  6 months 1996	 6 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		3,335.97   vs	 2,664.91</p>
<p>    Net profit		104.32   vs	    94.96</p>
<p>    Tax			  82.40   vs	    71.41</p>
<p>NOTE - Hayleys is the holding company of one of the three blue chip conglomerates listed in Colombo. The company consolidates accounts with over 25 groups firms.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
